            <p>Complete Windows Setup Guide for New Developers</p>
            <div class="badge">🎯 Follow these steps to get the project running on your Windows laptop</div>
        </div>

        <!-- OS Badge -->
        <div class="os-badge">
            🪟 Windows 10 / 11 | 💻 Visual Studio Code | 🐘 PostgreSQL | 📦 Node.js
        </div>

        <!-- Table of Contents -->
        <div class="toc">
            <h3>📑 Quick Navigation</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#prerequisites">1. Prerequisites</a></li>
                <li><a href="#clone">2. Clone Repository</a></li>
