                <li>☐ Database <code>tscf_db</code> created</li>
                <li>☐ Database tables created (ran database.sql)</li>
                <li>☐ <code>.env</code> file created in backend folder</li>
                <li>☐ <code>npm install</code> ran in both backend and frontend</li>
